  n=10     list comparisons=90           set lookups=10       same answer=True  ratio=       9:1
  n=100    list comparisons=8,775        set lookups=100      same answer=True  ratio=      88:1
  n=1000   list comparisons=875,250      set lookups=1,000    same answer=True  ratio=     875:1
  n=5000   list comparisons=21,876,250   set lookups=5,000    same answer=True  ratio=   4,375:1

the work grows quadratically for the list and linearly for the set:
  n=1000   comparisons=875,250       
  n=2000   comparisons=3,500,500       (4.0x the previous, for 2x the data)
  n=4000   comparisons=14,001,000      (4.0x the previous, for 2x the data)
